        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Ventricular dysfunction:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " not for other indications unless the benefit clearly outweighs the risk. With CHF risk factors (ischemic or valvular heart disease, significant pulmonary disease such as COPD, renal failure or other edematous disorders), review risks and benefits, treat with caution and monitor for CHF; stop if signs or symptoms of CHF appear. Heart failure was reported more often at a total daily dose of 400 mg, though also at lower doses."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
